  "description": "I accidentally spent a night with a stranger. And it was the male lead! \n\nI've tried so hard to live differently from the original! Even though things have turned out this way, the fact that the male and female leads had to be connected remained unchanged. Luciana tried to run away, no, to let it be a one-night stand, leaving Licht behind. \n\n*\"That's impossible.\"\n\"...Huh?\"\n\"Because last night, Young-Ae and I were imprinted on each other.\"* \n\nOh my. Her soul was already bound to the male lead, as if she were one body.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
